    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Reconstruct vesicle centers and nascent six-rayed spicules in developing hexactinellids, classify packing as cubic or close-packed, and test whether ray axes follow cubic nearest-neighbor directions. A close-packed arrangement with unchanged spicule geometry would refute the mechanism.";
